  m_text: "You have arrived in a subtropical region during the \nCretaceous Period.\nYour
    goal is to steal a T. Rex egg which contains ancient\nDNA required to restore
    Earth's ecosystems.\nThe grasslands are infested with Velociraptors. \nDo not
    let them see you. Crouch inside tall grass and bushes\nto avoid their line of
    sight. \nIf you can make it past the Velociraptors, you may distract \nthe mother
    T. Rex by picking up and throwing a rock. \nDo not get near the T. Rex--that
    means certain death.\nWait for the right opening, and steal the egg!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
